      "data": {
        "identity": {
          "graphId": "web-page-class",
          "nodeId": "web-page"
        },
        "markdown": "Web Page captures unresolved issues that block clarity.\n\nAuthored fields: `label`, `body`, `status`, `owner`, `resolutionPath`, `prominence`.\n\nThe detail surface represents the full editor contract; card and icon surfaces are deliberate projections.",
        "content": {
          "kind": "markdown",
          "value": "Web Page is a web page shown inside a node, when the site allows it; when it does not, a card that opens the page in a new tab.\n\nAuthored fields: `title`, `url`.\n\nWhen the address changes, Twilite asks the site whether it may be shown inside a page. If it may, the page is shown in the node; if it may not, the node says so and offers to open the page in a new tab."
        },
        "renderShape": {
          "kind": "markdown"
        }
      }
    },
